Regional Market Dynamics
•	North America: Leads in technology adoption with strong demand for smart luggage and premium products. The region benefits from established retail networks and high consumer spending power.
•	Europe: Sustainability drives innovation, with EU regulations pushing manufacturers toward eco-friendly materials and production methods. Germany and France remain key markets for high-end travel goods.
•	Asia-Pacific: The fastest-growing region, fueled by China's manufacturing prowess and India's expanding air travel market. Popular segments include affordable hard-case luggage and hybrid business-leisure bags.
•	Latin America: Shows strong potential in urban centers with demand for durable, value-oriented luggage featuring colorful designs and expandable capacity.
•	Middle East & Africa: Luxury travel goods perform well in GCC countries, while Africa demonstrates growing potential in business travel segments.
